1
00:00:00,982 --> 00:00:02,422
(Sheldon:)All right.
Let's just finish cooking.

2
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:05,390
Well... Hey. O-Okay.
Let me make this up to you.

3
00:00:05,453 --> 00:00:07,083
(Leonard:)Sometimes I keep
an online journal.

4
00:00:07,154 --> 00:00:08,824
(Leonard:)I want you to read
something that I write.

5
00:00:08,889 --> 00:00:10,729
(Penny:)Okay, really, I'm fine.
Okay.

6
00:00:10,791 --> 00:00:12,361
(Leonard:)Well, then I'll read it to you.

7
00:00:12,426 --> 00:00:14,866
(Leonard:)It's from the day we first met.

8
00:00:14,929 --> 00:00:16,659
(clears throat)

9
00:00:16,731 --> 00:00:20,001
"Beauty, thy name is Penny."
Oh, God.

10
00:00:20,067 --> 00:00:21,767
(Penny:)Stop.

11
00:00:21,836 --> 00:00:23,006
(Penny:)I don't want you

12
00:00:23,070 --> 00:00:24,470
(Leonard:)to read something
you think'll just butter me up.

13
00:00:24,538 --> 00:00:26,808
(Penny:)I want to hear
the most recent thing you wrote.

14
00:00:26,874 --> 00:00:28,644
(Amy:)Fine.

15
00:00:28,709 --> 00:00:29,979
(Leonard:)Mmm...

16
00:00:32,680 --> 00:00:35,720
"Penny's beauty,
like our love,

17
00:00:35,783 --> 00:00:39,053
(Leonard:)grows more with
each passing day."

18
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:40,190
(Penny:)Does it really say that?

19
00:00:40,254 --> 00:00:44,324
(high-pitched):
Why would I lie?

20
00:00:44,392 --> 00:00:47,562
"OMG. OMG.

21
00:00:47,628 --> 00:00:49,498
"We're so close
to the new Star Wars.

22
00:00:49,563 --> 00:00:51,663
"I can't take it.

23
00:00:51,732 --> 00:00:53,702
Gah."

24
00:00:53,768 --> 00:00:54,768
"Gah"?

25
00:00:54,835 --> 00:00:57,475
(Leonard:)Well, you didn't
read it right.

26
00:00:57,538 --> 00:01:06,028
The new Star Wars
is coming. Gah!

